                // So the condition is: (cur_idx + 1 > cur) || (pre.tail <= cur)
                // 
                // Given that pre satisfied the condition: (cur_idx > cur) || (pre.tail <= cur)
                // We need to show: (cur_idx + 1 > cur) || (pre.tail <= cur)
                // 
                // If (pre.tail <= cur), we're done.
                // Otherwise, (cur_idx > cur). Since cur_idx + 1 > cur_idx, we have cur_idx + 1 > cur.
